    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-news-release">News Release</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Fed President Patrick Harker Discusses Economic Outlook and Community Reinvestment Act</h1>


        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">17 Jan ’20</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">Patrick T. Harker, president of the Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia, told an audience of New Jersey bankers that the economy is looking “pretty good,” holding steady his view of the economic outlook.</p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


            </div>



        </div>


    </div>

</div>

